cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Solar Decomp: GHI to DNI+DHI solar irradiance decomposition"
abstract: >
  Solar Decomp is an open-source web application for decomposing global
  horizontal irradiance (GHI) into direct normal irradiance (DNI) and
  diffuse horizontal irradiance (DHI) using the DIRINT (Perez et al., 1992),
  Erbs (Erbs et al., 1982) and Reindl-2 (Reindl et al., 1990) models. It
  reads CSV, Excel and EPW files with 1-min, 15-min or 60-min data,
  includes a physical quality-control system, and exports results in CSV,
  Excel and JSON formats.
